     ("How should a construction company be paid?", "Through a payment schedule tied to stages verified on site (foundations, walls, slabs, weathertight), with retention money withheld from each payment."),
     ("Should you require the contractor's insurance?", "Yes: ask for the insurance certificates, in particular decennial civil liability, before work starts."),
