     ("Which law regulates the architectural profession in Morocco?", "Law No. 016-89 on the practice of the architectural profession, which also establishes the National Order of Architects."),
     ("Does the architect replace the engineering consultancy?", "No: the architect designs and obtains the permit; the BET calculates the structure and designs the technical networks."),
